{"id":"u-f792ceff-0218-4e1a-8825-85d15e431047","src":"community","title":"PPL Upper Lower - Randy","author":"Lukáš Randus","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/OxPA5h-boostcamppplupperlowerhypertrophystrength","desc":"PPL Upper Lower – Randy is an 11-week, 5-day training program designed to develop both muscle size and strength. The first three sessions follow a Push/Pull/Legs structure focused primarily on hypertrophy, using moderate-to-high volume, controlled repetitions and selected intensity techniques such as drop sets, rest-pause, myo-reps and partial repetitions.\n\nThe final two sessions are Upper and Lower strength days, built around heavier compound movements, lower rep ranges and progressive overload.\n\nThe program is designed for intermediate to advanced lifters who want to combine bodybuilding-style training with consistent strength progression without sacrificing either goal. Each major muscle group is trained approximately twice per training cycle with a different stimulus: higher-volume hypertrophy work and heavier strength-focused work.`","level":["Intermediate","Novice"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-03T01:48:30.119Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push - Hypertrophy","Pull - Hypertrophy","Legs - Hypertrophy","Upper - Strength","Lower - Strength"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"Last working set: reduce load ~25-30% and continue to near failure"},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled eccentric, full ROM"},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"After last set add 10-15 partial reps in stretched range"},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled eccentric"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"Last set: 12-20